---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PhotoGallery from '../components/PhotoGallery.astro';
import galleries from '../data/galleries.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const jogle = galleries.albums.find((a) => /jogle/i.test(a.name));
---
<BaseLayout title="The JOGLE" description="John O'Groats to Land's End by bike, the VSO warm-up before the drive to Sydney.">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head flow">
        <p class="eyebrow">The warm-up · from 31 August 2008</p>
        <h1>The JOGLE</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="prose flow">
        <p>
          As part of their attempt to raise as much money for VSO as possible, Ollie and Jenny are
          going to do 'The Jogle'. Jogle is an acronym for John O'Groats (to) Land's End. Ollie will
          be cycling the 1000 miles and Jenny will be driving Dino as the support vehicle, carrying,
          mainly various creams and lotions to keep Ollie going.
        </p>
        <p>
          In April 2007 Ollie ran the London Marathon in aid of VSO, and on completion was challenged
          to beat that for the next charity event. The original idea was to have a go at swimming the
          channel, but apparently you need to be able to swim to do this, and so Ollie had to go back
          to the drawing board. Eventually the idea of cycling from John O'Groats to Land's End took shape.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;">(Kept word for word from the original site.)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:var(--measure);">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">1000 miles, roughly a fortnight</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0;color:var(--ink-soft);">
          John O'Groats · Brora · Loch Ness · Glen Coe · Alexandria · Beattock · Shap · Shropshire ·
          Newent · Axbridge · Devon · Cornwall · Land's End.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel" style="margin-top:1.5rem;max-width:var(--measure);">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">The daily run</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 .6rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;">Recovered from the original site: roughly 70 miles a day, every day.</p>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem;columns:2;column-gap:2rem;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;">
          <li>John O'Groats → Brora</li>
          <li>Brora → Loch Ness</li>
          <li>Loch Ness → Glen Coe</li>
          <li>Glen Coe → Alexandria</li>
          <li>Alexandria → Beattock</li>
          <li>Beattock → Shap</li>
          <li>Shap → Charity Farm</li>
          <li>Charity Farm → Oxon Hall</li>
          <li>Oxon Hall → Newent</li>
          <li>Newent → Axbridge</li>
          <li>Axbridge → Waie</li>
          <li>Waie → Quintrell Downs → Land's End</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {jogle && (
        <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
          <h2>Photos from the ride</h2>
          <p style="margin:0 0 .4rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:var(--serif-display);font-size:.9rem;">
            {jogle.count} photos · {jogle.start}
          </p>
          <PhotoGallery photos={jogle.photos} />
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
